### ===========================================
### GESTÃO DE HOSPITAIS - TESTE COMPLETO
### ===========================================

### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@sistema.com
@adminPassword = admin123

### ===========================================
### 1. AUTENTICAÇÃO
### ===========================================

### Login como administrador
POST {{host}}/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

> {%
client.test("Login Admin Success", function() {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Login should return 200");
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.accessToken);
});
%}

### ===========================================
### 2. LISTAR HOSPITAIS
### ===========================================

### Listar todos os hospitais (endpoint principal)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar com paginação personalizada
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?page=0&size=5&sort=name,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar com filtro por cidade
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?city=São Paulo
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar com filtro por estado
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?state=SP
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar com múltiplos filtros
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?name=Santa&city=São Paulo&state=SP
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar apenas hospitais ativos
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/active
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Listar apenas hospitais inativos
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/inactive
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Buscar hospital por nome
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/search?query=Santa Casa
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ===========================================
### 3. CADASTRAR HOSPITAL
### ===========================================

### Cadastrar novo hospital completo
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Santa Casa de São Paulo",
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "phone": "(11) 3333-4444",
  "email": "contato@santacasa-sp.org.br",
  "address": "Rua Dr. Cesário Mota Jr, 112 - Vila Buarque",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

> {%
client.test("Hospital Created", function() {
    client.assert(response.status === 201, "Hospital creation should return 201");
    if (response.body.data) {
        client.global.set("hospital_id", response.body.data.id);
    }
});
%}

### Cadastrar hospital básico (campos mínimos)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Municipal de Campinas",
  "cnpj": "98.765.432/0001-21",
  "city": "Campinas",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Teste de validação - CNPJ duplicado (deve falhar)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro Hospital",
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "city": "Rio de Janeiro",
  "state": "RJ"
}

### Teste de validação - campos obrigatórios (deve falhar)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "(11) 9999-8888"
}

### ===========================================
### 4. VISUALIZAR INFORMAÇÕES
### ===========================================

### Visualizar hospital específico
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Visualizar hospital inexistente (deve retornar 404)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Resumo executivo dos hospitais
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Estatísticas dos hospitais
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ===========================================
### 5. EDITAR HOSPITAL
### ===========================================

### Atualizar informações completas do hospital
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Santa Casa de São Paulo - Unidade Central",
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "phone": "(11) 3333-5555",
  "email": "central@santacasa-sp.org.br",
  "address": "Rua Dr. Cesário Mota Jr, 112 - Vila Buarque - Centro",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Atualizar apenas alguns campos
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Santa Casa de São Paulo - Unidade Principal",
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "phone": "(11) 3333-6666",
  "email": "contato@santacasa-sp.org.br",
  "address": "Rua Dr. Cesário Mota Jr, 112 - Vila Buarque",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Teste de edição - hospital inexistente (deve falhar)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Teste",
  "cnpj": "11.111.111/0001-11",
  "city": "Teste",
  "state": "TS"
}

### ===========================================
### 6. ATIVAR/INATIVAR HOSPITAL
### ===========================================

### Verificar status atual do hospital
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Inativar hospital
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Verificar se foi inativado
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Ativar hospital novamente
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Verificar se foi ativado
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Alternar status (toggle)
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Verificar resultado do toggle
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Alternar novamente para voltar ao estado original
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/{{hospital_id}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ===========================================
### 7. ENDPOINTS ALTERNATIVOS (AdminController)
### ===========================================

### Listar hospitais (endpoint alternativo)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospitals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Cadastrar via endpoint alternativo
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospitals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital das Clínicas",
  "cnpj": "55.666.777/0001-88",
  "phone": "(11) 2661-0000",
  "email": "contato@hc.fm.usp.br",
  "address": "Av. Dr. Enéas Carvalho de Aguiar, 255",
  "city": "São Paulo", 
  "state": "SP"
}

