### ===========================================
### 9. TESTES DE PERFORMANCE E LIMITES
### ===========================================

### Listar com paginação grande
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Busca com termo muito específico
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management/search?query=XYZ123NAOEXISTE
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Filtros com valores não encontrados
GET {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management?city=CidadeInexistente&state=XX
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ===========================================
### 10. VALIDAÇÕES DE DADOS
### ===========================================

### CNPJ inválido
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Teste CNPJ",
  "cnpj": "123.456",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Estado inválido (mais de 2 caracteres)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Teste Estado",
  "cnpj": "77.888.999/0001-55",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SAO_PAULO"
}

### Email inválido
POST {{host}}/api/admin/hospital-management
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hospital Teste Email",
  "cnpj": "66.777.888/0001-44",
  "email": "email_invalido",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}